                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7acd68ae-8263-3efd-bea8-a7f9cd220f15",
                        "entry_id": "27388224-37eb-3e75-8260-e1e2b3454d66",
                        "glosses": [
                            "höchstmögliche Beschleunigung/Geschwindigkeit"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ffbeb49-3ea5-4c3c-b478-c533864a412b",
                                "sense_id": "7acd68ae-8263-3efd-bea8-a7f9cd220f15",
                                "text": "„Der Vogel flatterte hektisch herum, und ich gab Vollgas.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f340d461-0464-40b6-9987-973ab82cc616",
                                "sense_id": "7acd68ae-8263-3efd-bea8-a7f9cd220f15",
                                "text": "„Er legte den ersten Gang ein, schaute kurz in den Seitenspiegel und gab Vollgas.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a06c5cb2-5e1b-4991-bbdb-781e86c08d81",
                        "source_entry_id": "27388224-37eb-3e75-8260-e1e2b3454d66",
                        "source_sense_id": "7acd68ae-8263-3efd-bea8-a7f9cd220f15",
                        "source_sense_description": "höchstmögliche Beschleunigung/Geschwindigkeit",
                        "target_lang_word": "full throttle",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "full throttle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "33e9d1af-61e4-3a47-a66c-90de8b0d4ae0",
                                        "entry_id": "ff6bf458-a2b2-394f-9691-aa30acbe966f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A maximum setting on an engine or motor control: especially, the totally open position of a valve for air intake, but also any corresponding maximum setting."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8244a98-4a5a-408e-99ac-15a10d5b0b2d",
                                                "sense_id": "33e9d1af-61e4-3a47-a66c-90de8b0d4ae0",
                                                "text": "there was no further sign of any Nazi planes, Perry banked southward and went roaring home to Base on full throttles"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc48ddb5-e222-4808-8d89-139b0f4e6cf1",
                                                "sense_id": "33e9d1af-61e4-3a47-a66c-90de8b0d4ae0",
                                                "text": "its regs and serirs over which Land Rovers can race with full throttles and little chance of meeting any obstacle larger than a fist-sized stone."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d66ee41-07f5-4e93-a8ce-1464376b7263",
                                                "sense_id": "33e9d1af-61e4-3a47-a66c-90de8b0d4ae0",
                                                "text": "Under full throttle, your car is just on the border of maximum traction"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d9a02966-17bb-3826-b886-70629fea1204",
                                        "entry_id": "ff6bf458-a2b2-394f-9691-aa30acbe966f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A maximum level of speed, effort, or risk."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb6e5393-9d0f-4993-a79f-ba6094886fe0",
                                                "sense_id": "d9a02966-17bb-3826-b886-70629fea1204",
                                                "text": "I'm in the full throttles of an embrace and this is wonderful."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3f6ba27-4010-44ea-adea-efb667d5cd31",
                                                "sense_id": "d9a02966-17bb-3826-b886-70629fea1204",
                                                "text": "In the third week Dr. Gale shifted into full throttle back pedal."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c22a467b-70a9-47de-ae2a-4ced41852f2a",
                                                "sense_id": "d9a02966-17bb-3826-b886-70629fea1204",
                                                "text": "The full-throttle growth was still in place, as it had been as long as I could remember."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "full throttle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7ef3cdb6-fc13-3c57-806d-88cec316edaf",
                                        "entry_id": "4ce9295d-5a0a-3cdb-a0ab-e5df3bca0fc9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "All out; at maximum speed, effort, or risk."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ecdd47c8-3b49-4824-81c9-ab717770340c",
                                                "sense_id": "7ef3cdb6-fc13-3c57-806d-88cec316edaf",
                                                "text": "The other, the Christina Covey, there was another that never knowed the harbour, why, she come in full throttle"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01f62520-94f4-49c0-b59a-b1dabf354504",
                                                "sense_id": "7ef3cdb6-fc13-3c57-806d-88cec316edaf",
                                                "text": "Virtually all exercise authorities recommend some kind of warm-up period in each session before you go full throttle"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7166eeb3-3f26-40ed-a9a8-f430e0ea5f4d",
                                                "sense_id": "7ef3cdb6-fc13-3c57-806d-88cec316edaf",
                                                "text": "If Nonna had seen them, she would do the same as Dad, but I looked back to see her focused full throttle on whatever it was George was saying."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "27b52846-296a-41d3-be80-b2c33eb88d24",
                        "source_entry_id": "27388224-37eb-3e75-8260-e1e2b3454d66",
